## WordPress web design from £199

First impressions happen in under a second. A poorly designed website sends visitors straight to your competitor — a great one builds trust instantly and gets people to take action.

Our Web Design service is for WordPress website builds. A one-page WordPress website starts from **£199**, giving small businesses a clean, professional page with the essentials in place: strong branding, mobile-friendly layout, basic SEO foundations, and clear contact details.

Larger multi-page websites are quoted around your brief, including the number of pages, content, SEO work, forms, integrations, and any extra functionality required.

## Great design does the selling for you

Every website we create is built around your business. No generic layouts. Just a clean, professional site that looks the part and works hard for you.

## Logo design and branding for small businesses

Starting a new business or refreshing an existing one? We offer [logo design and brand identity](/services/logo-design/) for small companies across South Wales — giving you a professional look that works across your website, social media, signage, and print.

Your logo and brand colours are built into your website from day one, so everything feels consistent and considered. No mismatched visuals, no off-brand colours — just a cohesive identity that builds recognition and trust.

What's included in our branding service:

- Custom logo design (multiple concepts, revisions until you're happy)
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document for consistent use across all materials
- Logo files in all formats (PNG, SVG, PDF) for web and print

## Our WordPress build process

1. **Discovery** — We learn about your business, your customers, and what makes you different
2. **Design and structure** — We plan the layout, content flow, and calls to action
3. **WordPress build** — We build the page or website, mobile-first and SEO-aware
4. **Revisions** — We refine until you're happy
5. **Handover** — We show you how to use the site and discuss any ongoing support you need

## No AI. No templates. Designed by our team.

Every design we produce is created in-house by our designers — no AI-generated layouts, no purchased templates, no drag-and-drop builders. That means your website looks like yours, not like a thousand other businesses who bought the same theme.

AI design tools and template marketplaces have made it easy for anyone to get a website that looks passable. They've also made it easy for every business in your industry to end up with a site that looks almost identical. We don't work that way. Every project starts with a blank canvas and is built around your specific business, your customers, and what makes you different.

## What makes a good design?

Good web design isn't just about looking nice. It's about guiding visitors towards an action — a phone call, a form submission, a purchase. We design with that goal in mind on every page.

We pay close attention to typography, spacing, colour, and contrast to make your site feel premium and trustworthy — the kind of site that makes people confident to get in touch.

## Need something more custom?

If your project needs more complex functionality, deeper integrations, or a bespoke technical setup, our [web development team](/services/web-development/) can quote that separately.

[View our portfolio](/portfolio/) to see some of the websites we've designed and branded for South Wales businesses.

